      flavor: 3,
      episode: 6,
      priorEpisode: "/cookbook/beach-bum-creami",
      framing: "CrumblCreamiCut Week 2's third flavor — the first cross-recipe Creami in the series. Chains to the existing Protein Cheesecake Frosting cookbook entry as the Respin mix-in (frozen + chopped + poked into the first-spin surface). Same 1 cup Fairlife + whey + guar gum + salt foundation as the whole series. Lime gelatin mix (2 tsp) + 5 drops green food coloring blend into the base pre-freeze — the flavor + color identity carrier. Respin cycle for the mix-in distribution + texture finish (Beach Bum W2F2 pattern with a different mix-in). Post-scoop graham crust. This ep sets the template for cross-recipe Creamis where existing cookbook entries become mix-in components rather than requiring a new brand purchase.",
