      adult: "Full recipe as written — whole pint = 1 adult serving at ~370 cal / 48g protein. Ties W3F1 Mallow as the highest-protein Creami in the CrumblCreamiCut series so far.",
      kid: "Same base works as a smaller portion. Kids typically split a pint 2-3 ways vs the whole-pint-per-adult default. If the kid isn't into brownie pieces or white-chocolate drizzle, serve just the base — the red velvet color reads as a fun 'pink ice cream' on its own. Cut the brownie mix-in pieces smaller if serving under-4s.",
