    flavorTarget: "Restaurant-style sweet-heat glazed chicken — crispy bite, glossy coat, layered umami + chili + slight sweetness. The technique move: toss the air-fried chicken with warm TKS Sauce in a dry hot skillet 60-90 sec so the residual breading starch + sauce caramelize together. No cornstarch slurry, no xanthan. Real cling from real technique.",
