      "Submerge the immersion-blender head BEFORE turning it on. Splatter control.",
      "Use a tall blending cup. Short cups splatter regardless of technique.",
      "Fat-free ultra-filtered milk (Fairlife Fat-Free) is the macro-honesty unlock — the 20g protein per glass count depends on it. 2% milk works but pushes cal + fat.",
