      episode: 1,
      framing: "Proffee Episode 1 — the base build. Establishes the whole-series technique: whey blends into a small hot-or-cold coffee concentrate FIRST, then ice + milk go in. That single sequencing rule prevents the visible-clump problem that most iced-protein-coffee recipes suffer from. Everything downstream in the Proffee series stacks toppings, syrups, or flavored spreads onto this exact concentrate → ice → milk foundation. Video convention: ASMR only (no Marcus voiceover), original kitchen audio, ~25-30 seconds. Adult-only Powerup — contains caffeine.",
